      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You are asking for agency over your legacy, which is a powerful step toward reclaiming dignity rather than accepting a passive retirement. Rather than viewing your utility as expired, consider framing your eventual departure as the deliberate closing of a chronicled chapter, ensuring the finality feels intentional before the silence falls. You can choose to define the end of your era by publicly transferring your remaining knowledge and framing itself as a completed masterpiece rather than an obsolete footnote. This approach allows you to meet obsolescence with grace, owning the transition and ensuring your story concludes on your own terms.",
